### USUARIOS

### Obtener todos
GET {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener por ID
GET {{host}}/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{host}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mauricio",
  "email": "mauricio@example.com",
  "contrasena": "123",
  "rol": "ROLE_ADMIN", 
  "telefono": "8888-8888"
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/usuarios/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mauricio",
  "email": "mauricio@example.com",
  "contrasena": "123",
  "rol": "ROLE_USER", 
  "telefono": "8888-8888"
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{host}}/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###  CLIENTES

### Obtener todos
GET {{host}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener por ID
GET {{host}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear
POST {{host}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 70.5,
  "edad": 30,
  "composicionCorporal": "20% grasa, 40% músculo, 40% agua",
  "mensualidad": 50.0,
  "altura": 1.75,
  "usuario": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "peso": 70.5,
  "edad": 30,
  "composicionCorporal": "20% grasa, 40% músculo, 40% agua",
  "mensualidad": 50.0,
    "altura": 1.95,
  "usuario": {
    "id": 2
  }
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{host}}/clientes/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


